# then: saved_ws_after.script
# Save Workspace As (⌥⌘S) keeps the window's saved connections' tabs in
# workspaces.json (an unsaved connection is left out, said so); the next
# launch opens the layout from the Manage sheet into the untouched start
# window, renames one layout (stored again at the end, as the TUIs do) and
# deletes another
saved-add Local sqlite://$LACE_SMOKE_DB
connect-saved Local
table big
query SELECT 1
connect sqlite://$LACE_SMOKE_DB-other?create=1
answer Team
save-workspace
expect-notice left out
expect-saved-workspaces Team
answer Junk
save-workspace
expect-saved-workspaces Team|Junk
quit
